The following files need to be presentmin this directory:

Controls - Regression Control Panel.csv
FX.csv
nz_daily_flows.csv
US_Share_of_New_Zealand_Debt.xlsx - Regression Series.csv

They can be found in the regression folder in Google Drive.

Run the script with:
```bash
pip install numpy pandas scipy statsmodels matplotlib

python nz_bond_flows/code/run_regressions.py
```
